Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:13:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [Feature][PCP] Support DeepSeek-V4.1 decoder SWA replay
 with APC

Reuse the global scheduled PCP batch to trim decoder replay to the global tail while preserving APC slots and collective layouts.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: wangyicong <wangyicong@bytedance.com>
